Description: Git client with zlib-ng and hardened Trixie builds
 Git provides distributed revision control. This focused client build includes
 PCRE2, HTTPS, OpenSSL hashing, and git subtree, with static zlib-ng compression.
 .
 Server commands, Perl/Python integrations, GUI tools, translations, manual
 pages, and shell completion are not included.
